{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001828016","cik":"0001828016","slug":"playtika-holding-828016","name":"Playtika Holding Corp.","ticker":"PLTK","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Computer Processing & Data Preparation","sic":"7374","country":"Israel","website":"","listed_years":5.4,"first_annual":"2021-02-26","last_filing":"2026-06-22","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001828016&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Playtika Holding Corp. files with the SEC under \"Services-Computer Processing & Data Preparation\", based in Israel, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $2.8bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 5.5% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 74.2%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($91.7m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Gross margin of 74.2% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001828016"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 72.0% to 74.2% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001828016"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $91.7m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1828016/000182801626000034/0001828016-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001828016-26-000034"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.6% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1828016/000182801626000034/0001828016-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001828016-26-000034"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-6.7% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1828016/000182801626000034/0001828016-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001828016-26-000034"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $117.4m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1828016/000182801626000034/0001828016-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001828016-26-000034"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$463.1m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1828016/000182801626000034/0001828016-26-000034-index.htm","accession":"0001828016-26-000034"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.1% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1828016/000212553326000011/0002125533-26-000011-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 66.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.66,"consecutive":2,"current":0.742,"current_display":"74.2%","threshold_display":"66.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue gro